Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Hand rig grips, hinged knob and push doors, chest loot
 spill

- motion/hand.rs: finger grip solver (cylinder, sphere knob, flat palm,
  in-hand) wrapped around the arm IK in compose; ContactRequest.grips
  and HandTargets.grips carry it.
- play/doors.rs: two hinged doors usable from either face; the knob
  door is turned and ridden by the right hand, the push door is pushed
  with both palms; a door block collider while shut.
- interact::Grasp forwards per-hand grip shapes from interactables.
- items: ChestLoot spills its items out of an opened chest, refills.

